    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d492">

                <pb facs="0616" n="536" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg536"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-03-09"><hi rendition="#italic">March 9,
                        1901</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 574.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith a copy
                    of a letter from the United States consul at La Guaira, with the inclosures
                    which accompanied the letter. Consul Goldschmidt sends copies of several
                        receipts<anchor n="b" xml:id="d492-f1"/> obtained by Mr. Balz in return for
                    forced loans which he was required to pay to local authorities.</p>
                <pb facs="0617" n="537" xml:id="pg537"/>
                <p>There is also inclosed a statement from Mr. Balz, forwarded through
                    Lieutenant-Commander Sargent, commanding the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Scorpion.</hi></p>
                <p>Kindly return the copies of the receipts, with instructions as to what steps are
                    to be taken with reference to them.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis B.
                    Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d492-a1.xml" xpointer="d492-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d492-a2.xml" xpointer="d492-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
